{"title":"Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1ml2zew\" data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"107\"\u003eDiscover the Enchanting Beauty of the Queen Flock Collection\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"1088\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBring the magic of a snow-covered winter forest into your home with Queen Flock artificial Christmas trees from King of Christmas. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eInspired by the majestic Alpine Fir found throughout the mountainous landscapes of the Pacific Northwest, the Queen Flock features heavily snow-dusted branches, exceptional realism, and a graceful silhouette designed to create a breathtaking holiday centerpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"1088\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eRecognized by Forbes as the Best Flocked Tree of 2025, the Queen Flock has become one of our most celebrated collections for its luxurious appearance, realistic detail, and timeless winter charm.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eDesigned to feel elegant, cozy, and unforgettable, the Queen Flock transforms living rooms, entryways, and gathering spaces into warm seasonal retreats made for cherished holiday traditions. For those who love the natural green beauty of the Alpine Fir without the flock, the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/alpine-fir-trees\" title=\"Alpine Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eAlpine Fir\u003c\/a\u003e collection offers the same exceptional branch structure and refined silhouette in a classic evergreen finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eAvailable in both full and slim silhouettes, the Queen Flock is designed to suit a variety of spaces, from grand living rooms with room for a sweeping, full-profile tree to narrower layouts where a slim silhouette makes a more elegant fit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhy choose the Queen Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Queen Flock is the ultimate choice for those who want a premium flocked Christmas tree that goes beyond the ordinary. Its mixed PE and PVC foliage delivers exceptional texture and depth beneath the flock, creating a layered, dimensional appearance that feels genuinely lifelike. The heavy snow-dusted finish is applied with care to create the look of real snowfall clinging to every branch — not a uniform coating, but a natural, organic distribution that adds to the tree's overall realism and beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eWhether you are creating a serene, wintry atmosphere or a luxurious holiday showpiece, the Queen Flock delivers the kind of presence that makes a lasting impression.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eShould I choose the full or slim Queen Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Queen Flock collection is available in both full and slim silhouettes to accommodate different spaces and decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe full Queen Flock offers a wide, sweeping silhouette and a commanding presence. Its fuller profile gives you ample room for ornaments, ribbon, and garland, making it ideal for larger living rooms, great rooms, or open spaces where you want a grand, breathtaking tree as your holiday focal point.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe slim Queen Flock delivers the same stunning flock finish and premium mixed foliage in a narrower, more upright profile. It is an excellent option for apartments, smaller living rooms, entryways, or any space where a full-width tree feels too large.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Queen Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Queen Flock's white flocked finish and premium foliage make it a stunning canvas for a wide range of holiday decorating styles. It pairs beautifully with cool, icy palettes — silver, white, and blue for a classic winter wonderland look. It also works exquisitely with warm gold and champagne accents, blush and dusty rose tones for a romantic aesthetic, or traditional deep burgundy and emerald for a dramatic, high-contrast display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIts layered branch structure also creates beautiful depth with \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/ribbons\" title=\"Christmas Ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e and garland, and the flock finish adds a softness that makes warm white lighting feel especially magical.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Queen Flock available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Queen Flock collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur pre-lit Queen Flock artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that glows warmly through the snow-dusted branches, creating a soft, luminous, and truly enchanting effect. With Power Pole Technology, setup is seamless — no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat is the difference between the King Flock and Queen Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe King Flock and Queen Flock are both premium flocked artificial Christmas trees crafted with mixed PE and PVC foliage. However, they differ in their inspiration, silhouette, and overall character.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Queen Flock is inspired by the Alpine Fir of the Pacific Northwest and carries a graceful, elegant presence. The branches have a triple tiered structure, which gives the tree more of a wispy and layered silhouette.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe \u003ca title=\"King Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-flock-trees\"\u003eKing Flock\u003c\/a\u003e brings its own distinct personality with a bold, full presence and the same premium mixed foliage construction. It is an excellent choice for those who want a high-quality flocked tree with a more classic and commanding shape. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Queen Flock easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eYes. The Queen Flock is designed for easy setup, long-term durability, and convenient after-season storage. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, creating a full and beautifully shaped tree with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and fluff the branches during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree and its flock finish protected between holiday seasons. Minimal shedding is expected during initial set up and takedown.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhen the season is over, the Queen Flock disassembles easily and stores neatly in a cool, dry place, preserving the flock, foliage, and overall condition of your tree for many years of continued use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eExplore the full Queen Flock collection and find the size and silhouette that turns your home into an unforgettable winter retreat this holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642896805952,"sku":"QF-T6.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5_67d3c5cc-8f63-4646-82b6-ac5667cde3ad.jpg?v=1718158334"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897068096,"sku":"QF-T6.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_7831fc2c-0c60-49cb-9368-a7127a8aaa1c.jpg?v=1722012623"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642897461312,"sku":"QF-T7.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5.jpg?v=1718158615"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897657920,"sku":"QF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_27cc53c6-965e-42b2-aec7-3712ea7dcff9.jpg?v=1722012616"},{"product_id":"9-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642898804800,"sku":"QF-T9-L","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_570c2957-702c-4393-95f3-99e0455c528e.jpg?v=1722012619"},{"product_id":"10-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1300 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642900377664,"sku":"QF-T10-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_8290f7cc-4dda-4d7d-bfbf-bc58b0b18dbc.jpg?v=1722012625"},{"product_id":"9-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"9' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","descript