d cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":32364637716557,"sku":"QFS-T6.5-L","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlockSlim_c84ff106-7f3e-4126-b467-263d8999e7b5.jpg?v=1722012683"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":32364637749325,"sku":"QFS-T7.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-2.jpg?v=1718158781"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree With 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":32364638109773,"sku":"QFS-T7.5-L","price":549.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlockSlim_d8e32bdd-7505-4f94-9917-017201397331.jpg?v=1722012684"},{"produc