s and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":32364638765133,"sku":"QFS-T12-L","price":1799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlockSlim_037081ba-4227-46f2-b730-3258ae898b6d.jpg?v=1722012655"},{"product_id":"8-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"8' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree With 700 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":37749584396488,"sku":"QFS-T8-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlockSlim_b6755209-8c14-4ff2-9200-f44d0f609b19.jpg?v=1722012680"},{"product_id":"10-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"10' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":41324700664008,"sku":"QF-T10-U","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\