chanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128138555592,"sku":"QF-T7.5-LUX","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7.5_QueenFlockArtificialChristmasTreeLux.jpg?v=1782848477"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Queen_Flock.jpg?v=1722361707","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/queen-flock-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}